# English-only deliverables

Write all project output in English:

- Source code, comments, and identifiers
- UI strings, labels, toasts, and error messages
- Documentation (README, technical docs, commit messages)
- GitHub profile content and workflow-generated text

The user may communicate in Turkish; responses and artifacts stay in English unless they explicitly ask for Turkish in a specific deliverable.

When editing existing Turkish content, translate it to English as part of the change.

Do not translate gitignored private strategy files unless the user explicitly requests it.
